      en: ["Shipbuilding hub", "On the Beneden-Merwede river", "Long riverfront", "Industrial sector"],
      es: ["Centro de construcción naval", "En el río Beneden-Merwede", "Larga línea de costa", "Sector industrial"],
      pt: ["Centro de construção naval", "No rio Beneden-Merwede", "Longa linha costeira", "Setor industrial"],
